WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.000
[Birds chirping cheerfully in the morning forest]

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:08.000
[Big Buck Bunny wakes up and stretches in the sun]

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.500
[Gentle breeze whispers through the green meadow flowers]

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.000
[A fluttering butterfly lands softly on a leaf]

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
[Rustling in the tree canopy... the mischievous trio appears]
